<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CNB-120 INDEX RISES 8.8 POINTS TO 709.3 PTS.</title>
<headline>CZECH CNB-120 INDEX RISES 8.8 POINTS TO 709.3 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 8.8 points on Tuesday to 709.3 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Six of the ten sectoral indices rose, with the construction index rising the most, up 19.5 points to 860.0.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
